      "id": "claim_14fb9b20b02d4d8699585b13cc70863c",
      "statement": "The slides backend enforces two deterministic ceilings before any HTTP call: a slide-count ceiling (MAX_SLIDES = 60, overridable via openrouter.max_slides) and a whole-deck encoded-byte ceiling (MAX_TOTAL_ENCODED_BYTES = 48 MiB); exceeding either raises SlideDescribeError and hard-fails with no chunking.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://transcriber/backends/slides.py#L392-L415",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:990c8ad08058732acf62086c992d971e97fc838e14262c87f0800378a59ebdf2:"
